          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, yeyi Nzambi yami, nukukutúumbakeshaŋa, nukusakililaŋa ijina deyi, muloŋa wuneli yuma yakuhayama, joji mpùŋa jakushankulu jiwelili mwakashinshi nimwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mukala wunawubalumuni dehi kwamulumba hohu, mukala wampwembu hinyilumba nyilumba, dadiŋi itala dadiwahi dawantu akwacheŋi kwikala nawa mukalanehi, hiyamba kawutuŋa nawa chepuku haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chakakulemeshelawu antu akweti Ŋovu, nimukala wanyuza yatiyawu antu womawakakutiya woma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanochu chiwunekali wumpwembu yawatuzweŋi, wumpwembu yawantu abula yuma hamonaŋwu kukala, wuweyaminu wanvula yeneni, wuwulelu wahankanza, helaŋi atiyawu woma hiyadi neyinvula yeneni yikweta hambaŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwamweneshaŋi nkanza hampataya kadi meji, dichi chiwakamwenesha ipumba dawantu akwacheŋi, nichamwenaŋa iyena nawulelu wevu, dichi chakamwena nikamina kawantu atiyaloŋawu antu woma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hampidiyi Yehova wamazaza wakatelekela nyuza yawantu yejima chawija chambiji januna, chawija chakudya najivinyu jajiwahi, chambijinuna jasweja manji mumafwaha, chajivinyu jajiwahi jakutata chachiwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu akahosha nawu, Talenu yeniwu diyi Nzambi yetu tunamuchiŋilili, wukutwamwina. Yeniwu diyi Yehova; tunamuchiŋilili, tukutiya kuwaha nakuzaŋalala nawamwinu windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hampidiyidihu hakanookela chikasa chaYehova, niaMowabi akayidatola mwawumwekalawu, neyi chadatolaŋa awu matahu mumeji akumulumba watuji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akolola makasawu mukachi ketuŋa dawu, neyi chololaŋa mukwakusala makasindi kulonda asali; wakafwomona wanta wawu wadinkawu hamunawukala wenu wakumakasawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpwembu yenu yasweja kukola yayilehi, yena nayisandi dehi, nayihumuni dehi, nayishikŋi dehi heseki, lwenimulunkuŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
